## Overview

### Purpose

{{formDescription}}

### Key Features

- **Auto-save:** Responses automatically saved every 30 seconds
- **Draft Mode:** Users can save progress and return later
- **Validation:** Required fields validated before submission
- **Progress Tracking:** Visual progress bar and step indicators
- **Responsive Design:** Works on desktop and mobile devices
{{#if requiresManager}}
- **Access Control:** Manager-only access via requireManager() middleware
{{/if}}

### Form Flow

1. User navigates to `{{formUrl}}`
{{#if requiresManager}}
2. System verifies manager authentication
{{else}}
2. System verifies user authentication
{{/if}}
3. Form loads existing draft (if any)
4. User answers questions step-by-step
5. Responses auto-save every 30 seconds
6. User can manually save draft at any time
7. User submits completed form
8. System validates all required fields
9. Form marked as completed in database

