  "form": {
    "id": "clx123...",
    "completed": false,
    "updatedAt": "2025-11-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Status Codes:**
- `200` - Success
- `400` - Bad request (invalid data)
- `401` - Unauthorized
{{#if requiresManager}}
