## Usage

### For End Users

1. Navigate to `{{formUrl}}`
{{#if requiresManager}}
2. Log in with manager credentials
{{else}}
2. Log in with your credentials
{{/if}}
3. Answer questions at your own pace
4. Form auto-saves every 30 seconds
5. Click "Save Draft" to manually save progress
6. Click "Next" to move between questions
7. Click "Submit Form" when all questions are answered
8. Confirm submission successful

### For Developers

#### Adding New Questions

1. Edit `src/lib/forms/{{formSlug}}-questions.ts`
2. Add question object to `questions` array
3. Update tests if needed
4. Test thoroughly before deploying

#### Modifying Validation

1. Edit validation logic in `src/lib/forms/{{formSlug}}-questions.ts` (`validateResponses` function)
2. Update API route validation in `src/app/api/{{formSlug}}/route.ts`
3. Add corresponding tests

#### Changing Access Control

{{#if requiresManager}}
To change from manager-only to all users:
1. Remove `requireManager()` import from page component
2. Replace with `requireAuth()` for all authenticated users
3. Update tests to use regular user credentials
{{else}}
To change from all users to manager-only:
1. Import `requireManager()` in page component
2. Replace `requireAuth()` calls with `requireManager()`
3. Update tests to use manager credentials
{{/if}}

